The AMBER pGM patch (this directory) is distributed by its authors, who are AMBER developers. It contains
only the pGM source files and the changes (hooks) to PMEMD; it contains no AMBER source code beyond the
context lines of the hooks patch. It is useful only with an AMBER24 source tree obtained under the AMBER
license (https://ambermd.org); building and using the patched PMEMD, and redistributing the patched PMEMD
itself, are subject to that license. The pGM source files carry the copyright notices in
src/pmemd/src/pGM/copyright_pgm.i and src/pmemd/src/cuda/copyright_PGM.i.
